ls-hpack
------------------------------------------
LS-HPACK provides functionality to encode and decode HTTP headers using HPACK
compression mechanism specified in RFC 7541.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libls-hpack-devel-2.3.5-1bl1
  libls-hpack2-2.3.5-1bl1
  libxxhash0-0.8.4-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libxxhash-devel-0.8.4-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/litespeedtech/ls-hpack

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/litespeedtech/ls-hpack/archive/refs/tags/v2.3.5.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ls-hpack-2.3.5-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ls-hpack-2.3.5-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ls-hpack-2.3.5-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ls-hpack-2.3.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libls-hpack2-2.3.5-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libls-hpack-devel-2.3.5-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(ls-hpack)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/ls-hpack.README
  /usr/share/doc/ls-hpack/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/ls-hpack/README.md

(libls-hpack2)
  /usr/bin/cygls-hpack-2.dll

(libls-hpack-devel)
  /usr/include/ls-hpack/lshpack.h
  /usr/include/ls-hpack/lsxpack_header.h
  /usr/lib/libls-hpack.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/ls-hpack.pc

